  "content": "<h2>關於</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/beautify-refabricated?color=00AF5C&label=downloads&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_809311_downloads.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/809311.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本\"></a></p>\n<h6>這是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-decorate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beautify</a> 的<strong>非官方 Fabric 版本</strong>，採用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Pandarix/Beautify/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT</a> 許可證授權，請支持原版作品！</h6>\n<h2>模組內容</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/82240d271f55e1b30163f5c889c8d4f95414748cf105a2fc59511d868f8dca48/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f744453426968552e6a70672e706e67\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/cfe784fb6b44808f1e82645adcb35ff730f3565c4a536ff65520b869e15ac803/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f61566e3442366d2e676966\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>什麼是 Beautify？</strong></span></p>\n<p>Beautify 是一款客戶端與伺服器端的<strong>裝飾模組</strong>，透過自訂模型提供多種<strong>原版風格</strong>的方式來豐富您的建築細節。</p>\n<p>開發此模組的目標是在不扼殺想像力與創造力的前提下，增加建築的細節。<br>\n此外，大多數方塊都包含新功能。例如，盆栽植物（如 1 格高的花朵）可以使用骨粉進行複製。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>[Fabric] 支援版本：</strong> 1.18.2 | 1.19.2 | 1.20.x</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>更多圖片：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7wHu3qe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LGUotre.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M7AfS0o.png?1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"446\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/63BR9j4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\">更多範例圖片</span></a></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#9cf\">&nbsp;<strong>由 Jeikir 提供的展示影片：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5uXGHUit038?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p></div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>功能摘要：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">懸掛花盆</span>：具有自訂花卉模型，並支援多種植物</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">書堆</span>：擁有不同模型，可為附魔台供能</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">百葉窗</span>：為窗戶增添細節或創造新型入口</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">畫框</span>：包含所有 16x16 原版繪畫主題及更多內容</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">繩索</span>：懸掛花盆和其他方塊可附著其上，玩家也可攀爬</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">新型光源</span>：竹籠、燭台/吊燈、光蘊瓶、燈泡</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">格子架</span>：可用於在牆壁和天花板上放置植物</li>\n<li><em>更多內容即將推出</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>有關方塊及其用途的更多資訊，請<span style=\"color:#9cf\"><a style=\"color:#9cf\" href=\"https://github.com/Pandarix/Beautify/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">瀏覽維基！</a></span></em></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">鳴謝：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:400\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/CapoFantasma97\" rel=\"nofollow\">CapoFantasma97</a></strong>&nbsp;(義大利語翻譯)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:400\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/ocarinayoy\" rel=\"nofollow\">ocarinayoy</a>&nbsp;</strong>(西班牙語翻譯)</span></p>",
